WEBVTT

00:03:59.954 --> 00:04:01.746
let me see a show of hands.

00:04:01.788 --> 00:04:02.954
Great.

00:04:02.954 --> 00:04:04.704
But there are those who don't.

00:04:04.704 --> 00:04:08.704
Black people went from having
absolutely no rights

00:04:08.704 --> 00:04:11.913
to the US electing
its first Black president.

00:04:12.329 --> 00:04:17.829
Our civil rights gains paved the way
for the women's movement,

00:04:17.871 --> 00:04:21.538
the gay rights movement
and the social movements of today.

00:04:21.579 --> 00:04:26.121
In the 1960s we had found ourself,

00:04:26.163 --> 00:04:28.996
and James Brown led the way.

00:04:28.996 --> 00:04:32.704
"Say it loud, I'm Black and I'm proud."